  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Simplifying the given expression we get,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>5</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>adj</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>5</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>(</mo><mo>adj</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>)</mo><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>5</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>(</mo><mo>adj</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>)</mo><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>4</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>5</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>(</mo><mo>adj</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>)</mo><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>5</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>5</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>(</mo><mo>adj</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>)</mo><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>5</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>-</mo><mo>adj</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>)</mo><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>5</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>adj</mo><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>So,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, sum of elements of matrix&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p>",
